          "question": "What information is needed for a quotation?",
          "answer": "Send pair quantity, color-size mix, packaging needs and destination. Product price, freight and service requirements are quoted for the requested order."
        },
        {
          "question": "Can I request a sample?",
          "answer": "Share the preferred color, EU size and destination. Sample availability, charges and timing will be confirmed."
